# Public Supabase project identifiers for production — safe to commit:
# Postgres RLS protects data, not key secrecy (same reasoning as the
# WXT_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY / VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY values
# already used locally — see extension/utils/supabase.ts,
# web/src/supabase.ts). Kept unprefixed here since this file is the one
# shared source for every deployable app's build, not tied to any single
# bundler's env-var convention (Vite's VITE_, WXT's WXT_, ...) — `just
# deploy-web` maps these onto web/Dockerfile's VITE_-prefixed build args.
SUPABASE_URL=https://ubwyvndbkdxxoujqgrzz.supabase.co
